Subject: [PATCH] net: mdio: i2c: keep short RollBall transfers as transport errors

A short unlock transfer is not proof that a module lacks a RollBall
bridge. Return EIO, retaining the existing explicit NACK and completed
probe fallback policy for supported media converters.

--- a/drivers/net/mdio/mdio-i2c.c
+++ b/drivers/net/mdio/mdio-i2c.c
@@ -423,7 +423,7 @@
 		return ret;
 	}
 	if (ret != 1)
-		return -ENODEV;
+		return -EIO;
 
 	return i2c_mii_probe_rollball(i2c);
 }
